{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在教室里只是朋友。", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "两人独处的时候是恋人。", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我终于也习惯这样切换的生活了。", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理，下一堂课要换教室吧？一起走吧。”", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4301", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好，在那之前可以去一趟职员室吗？”", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_ar6589", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好啊。唉，就快到寒假了……”", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4302", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是在教室里越是忍耐，两人独处时的情绪就越是激昂。", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "要是对本人说了她反而会在意过头，所以我保持沉默。", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪其实是个很爱撒娇的人。", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "以前那个叫我渣虫的女孩子，现在却发出撒娇的声音黏在我身边。", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的这一面除了我之外没有人知道，这让我产生了一点优越感。", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾，我们也差不多该换教室了。”", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 400, "voice": "_ht1752", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，也对。”", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "跟隼太离开教室，我看着走在我们前面的纱凪跟濑名同学。", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "刻意拉开的距离让我觉得胸口有些骚动。", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4303", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪回头看了我们一眼，然后对我微笑。", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我差点就要朝她挥手，但是忍住了。", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这样的日子一直持续着。", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜～？”", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "_pn0620", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“熊喵，趴得舒服吗？”", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呜噜～♪”", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "_pn0621", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "很难得趴在我头上的熊喵发出开心的叫声。", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4304", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "另一边，则是心情不悦的女朋友。", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪，怎么了？”", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……从刚才开始，熊喵就一直得意地看着我。”", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4305", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“熊喵？”", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呜噜？”", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "_pn0622", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾的头上就那么好吗？”", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4306", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呜噜～♪”", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "_pn0623", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“看吧，它绝对是在挑衅我。这个喜欢男人的熊喵～”", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4307", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她在忌妒？", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "可是对象是熊喵，我也不知道该做何反应。", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“既然要趴在新吾头上，那就来我这边吧。因为那个人是我的所以不行！”", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4308", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜（转头）”", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "_pn0624", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔唔，居然完全无视我～！”", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4309", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“够了快点下来！能趴在新吾身上的人只有我！”", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4310", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呜噜♪”", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "_pn0625", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊喂！不要发出撒娇的声音！”", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4311", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "争抢着我头上位置的一人和一只。", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这算是身为男人的荣幸吗？", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嘿咻，大家辛苦了～”", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 390, "voice": "_mu3304", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“辛苦了，学姐。”", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜、噜♪”", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "_pn0626", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一看到美羽学姐来到社团教室，熊喵立刻转移阵地到平常待的地方。", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“小熊喵今天趴在新吾头上啊。要说谢谢喔～”", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 390, "voice": "_mu3305", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呜噜～♪”", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "_pn0627", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“小纱凪辛苦了～”", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 390, "voice": "_mu3306", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊、是、是的，辛苦了……”", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4312", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪跟我保持距离，生硬地回应。", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我想想，今天小爱理她们休息，所以……”", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 390, "voice": "_mu3307", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“外面的工作交给我。”", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，不，外面的我来做没关系喔。”", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 390, "voice": "_mu3308", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那我来帮忙。”", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我没有多想就这么说了，但随即意识到不对。", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4313", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就人数来说，我帮忙学姐的话纱凪就得一个人做。", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，纱凪……”", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……那我在里面工作喔。”", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4314", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪背对我，距离又更远了。", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这种时候该怎么办才好？", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为交往了所以就跟她一起工作，不帮忙美羽学姐。", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……我觉得这样也不对。", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“外面真的我一个人就可以了，呐？”", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 390, "voice": "_mu3309", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐这么说，然后跟熊喵一起离开了社团教室。", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "剩下的我和纱凪都没说话。", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“学姐一个人做很辛苦的，纱凪去帮她吧？”", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "与其我去，她去比较好。", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是纱凪回头看我。", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不用在意，新吾去帮她吧。”", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4315", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只要美羽学姐在，我就没办法像在教室里那样自然地切换态度。", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一举一动都很不自然。", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好了别发呆了，快去帮忙吧。”", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4316", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也得检查备品库存才行……”", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4317", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我知道了。那结束后一起回家吧？”", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。新吾也加油喔。”", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4318", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪没有回头，开始动手工作。", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这一天回家时。", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪的情绪显得有点低落。", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "即使牵着手走路，她的脚步也很沉重。", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哪里不舒服吗？”", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……没有啊。”", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4319", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这样的问答其实也不是第一次。", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然知道原因是美羽学姐，但看得出来纱凪并不想谈论这件事。", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“果然啊。”", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4320", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯？”", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾很受女孩子欢迎呢，虽然从以前就是这样了。”", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4321", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么突然说这个？”", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“今天下课时间也是，有个女生说想跟新吾一起过圣诞节，所以想跟你告白喔。”", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4322", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“很可爱的女生。”", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4323", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……连那样的女孩也喜欢新吾，我吓了一跳。”", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4324", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“别的女生怎么样都无所谓。”", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“为什么？受人欢迎新吾不开心吗？”", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4325", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“有这样的人当我的男朋友，我也很骄傲喔。”", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4326", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这不是她的真心话。", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我知道，所以我没有笑，表情严肃地凝视纱凪。", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“其实啊。”", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4327", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果你花心我也不会生气的，但是不要让我知道喔。”", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4328", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我就这么不能信任？”", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“只、只是如果嘛。”", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4329", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我不会花心，但是如果真的发生了你应该生气。”", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4330", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没想到我被想成是会花心的男人。", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我很难过，同时也觉得沮丧。", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……不会生气喔。”", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4331", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪这样说，靠在我的胸前。", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为我喜欢新吾喜欢到那种事也不会生气。”", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4332", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样算是方便的女人吗？”", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4333", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "听到纱凪说出这些话，我用力抱紧她。", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "柔软到让人惊讶的身躯。", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好像会弄坏一样。", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……抱歉。我果然还是不要你花心，绝对不要。”", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_sn4334", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我不会的。都有纱凪了我怎么可能会那样做。”", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "两颗心一点一点靠近。", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们都对彼此诉说发自内心的真心话。", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
